---
description: Vector implementation workflow
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md and P0 docs before coding. Read docs/26 when the work touches onboarding, domains, hosting, delivery, launch, or scaling. Read docs/27 when the work touches public frontend, funnels, landing pages, conversion, motion, or CRO. Read docs/28 when the work touches Control Plane UI or Vector product identity. Read docs/29 when the work touches client media, image or video generation, composition, derivatives, rights, or creative approval. Read docs/30 when the work touches authenticated client UX, goals, sales outcomes, revenue, data health, notifications, or entitlements. Read docs/plans/SHIP_REMAINING.md before picking the next unimplemented slice. Read docs/plans/OUTCOMES_TRACK.md when the work touches client-simple nav, Today, Approvals, or Outcomes QuickStart. Read docs/plans/CREATIVE_TRACK.md when the work touches ImageProvider or brand visual profile. Read docs/plans/FIRST_REVEAL_TRACK.md when the work touches first client website preview, visual-direction candidates, or first-impression QA. Read docs/plans/CLIENT_VALUE_TRACK.md when the work touches client ROI, replacement cost, time savings, or value statements. Read docs/plans/06_PHASE_6_SEO_AEO.md and docs/10 when the work touches SEO, AEO, GEO, structured data, search providers, answer targets, or generative-visibility measurement.
Implement one bounded vertical slice at a time. Do not build the whole platform in one change.
Before changes: state the goal, affected modules, security or tenancy impact, and tests to add.
If the work is onboarding, domains, analytics, or automation, ask whether it supports repeatable client launch without custom engineering.
After changes: run relevant tests, update docs, and record material ADRs.
If a repeated manual launch step appears, record it, automate it if safe, add a test, and update Vector 24 metrics.
Match sibling files. No drive-by refactors. Do not invent files to store chat analysis.
